  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Rendang is not a curry with sauce. It is a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "dry-curry"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "dry curry "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". The coconut milk cooks down over several hours until it evaporates completely and the beef then fries in the coconut oil. This is the stage that creates the dark, caramelised exterior that defines the dish. Rushed rendang is an ordinary braise. Patient rendang is extraordinary."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This recipe uses desiccated coconut toasted in a dry pan as a substitute for traditional "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "kerisik"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "kerisik "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". The "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "minangkabau-cooking"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "Minangkabau cooking"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " tradition this comes from has strict rules about rendang. Following the process faithfully produces results very close to the original."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
